      "skos:definition": "Terms from the WHO handbook 'National health workforce accounts: a handbook', second edition (2023, ISBN 9789240081291), held in this library as 9789240081291-eng. Three kinds of concept: the NHWA itself; its 4 modules and 29 indicators (notation is the handbook's own indicator number, and each indicator is broader-linked to its module and related to the Glossary terms its metadata sheet lists); and the 48 entries of the handbook's Glossary (pp. 87-93). Definitions are the handbook's own words, verbatim; nothing is paraphrased. Labels are Capitalized; where that changes the handbook's spelling, the handbook's form is kept as an altLabel. Every term is a candidate until a person confirms it. The library ingest missed the Glossary and the 4 – 04 metadata sheet, so those were read from the PDF text layer.",
