          "@value": "National Health Workforce Accounts"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        "NHWA"
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "a system by which countries progressively improve the availability, quality, and use of data on health workforce through monitoring of a set of indicators to support achievement of Universal Health Coverage, Sustainable Development Goals and other health objectives"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Quoted from Part I, \"Definition\" (PDF page 21). The handbook introduces it with \"The NHWA can be defined as –\" and gives it in quotation marks.",
      "dcterms:source": "library/9789240081291-eng/sections/sec-011-definition.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
