      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "From the Glossary of the handbook (p. 88; PDF page 102). The library ingest of this edition has no Glossary section, so the definition was extracted from the PDF text layer on 2026-10-31 and needs a person to confirm it. The handbook cites its reference 69 for this entry.",
      "dcterms:source": "uploads/9789240081291-eng/9789240081291-eng.pdf#page=102",
